{%- render 'kollab-home-head' -%}
<section class="sec with" id="with">
{%- if section.settings.chain -%}<img class="chain px" data-depth="0.22" data-max="24" data-sway="5" src="{{ section.settings.chain | image_url: width: 300 }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}
<div class="wrap">
<div class="rv">
<div class="kicker" style="color:#fff"><svg><use href="#kh-star" fill="url(#kh-ch)"/></svg>Kollab With Us</div>
<h2 class="h2"><span class="ln">Are you a Brand? Influencer?</span><span class="ln">Community? Vendor? <span class="i mark">Let's kollab.<svg viewBox="0 0 300 100" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path d="M10 88 C 80 78, 200 76, 292 84 M 30 94 C 120 86, 220 86, 270 92"/></svg></span></span></h2>
</div>
<div class="wtabs rv d1" role="tablist" aria-label="Who are you">
<button type="button" class="wtab" role="tab" aria-selected="true" data-w="brand">Brand</button>
<button type="button" class="wtab" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-w="creator">Influencer</button>
<button type="button" class="wtab" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-w="community">Community</button>
<button type="button" class="wtab" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-w="vendor">Vendor</button>
</div>
<div class="wpanel on" id="w-brand">
<div>
<h3><span>Enter the U.S. market</span><span class="i">from a real shelf, not a slide deck.</span></h3>
<p class="p"><span>Retail on Broadway. Pop-ups in new cities.</span><span>You ship the product. We build the moment around it.</span></p>
<div class="wcta"><a class="pill red" href="#contact" data-who="Brand">Request a brand deck</a><a class="pill ghost" href="#contact" data-who="Brand">Request a pop-up</a></div>
</div>
<div class="ways">
<div class="way"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2"><path d="M4 9h16v11H4zM4 9l2-5h12l2 5"/></svg></div><div><b>Retail at KOLLAB LA</b><p>A dedicated shelf in a 731 S. Broadway storefront, with our staff selling and sampling your line every day.</p></div></div>
<div class="way"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2"><path d="M3 12h18M12 3c3 3 3 15 0 18M12 3c-3 3-3 15 0 18"/></svg></div><div><b>Pop-ups we host ourselves</b><p>Seoul Social Club, Global K-Zone and BLOOMHAUS are KOLLAB-run activations in LA, Atlanta and Dallas. In 2027 we take K-brands to more U.S. cities.</p></div></div>
<div class="way"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="m10 9 5 3-5 3z"/></svg></div><div><b>Marketing, your way</b><p>Workshops, seminars, influencer collaborations and content: online and offline marketing shaped around what your brand needs.</p></div></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="wpanel" id="w-creator">
<div>
<h3><span>Get paid to tell</span><span class="i">the stories you already love.</span></h3>
<p class="p"><span>Paid K-brand collabs and first access to launches.</span><span>We match on fit, not just follower count.</span></p>
<div class="wcta"><a class="pill red" href="#contact" data-who="Influencer">Join the creator list</a><a class="pill ghost" href="https://instagram.com/kollab_la" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Follow @kollab_la</a></div>
</div>
<div class="ways">
<div class="way"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 3v18M3 12h18"/></svg></div><div><b>Paid collab matching</b><p>Tell us your niche and rates once. We bring you brand briefs that fit, with clear deliverables and payment terms.</p></div></div>
<div class="way"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M8 12h8M12 8v8"/></svg></div><div><b>Discord and meetups</b><p>A private creator Discord, monthly networking nights at the store and first invites to every pop-up.</p></div></div>
<div class="way"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2"><path d="M4 20h16M6 16l4-8 4 5 4-9"/></svg></div><div><b>Shoot in store</b><p>Book the KOLLAB space for your own content days, with product on hand and our team to help.</p></div></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="wpanel" id="w-community">
<div>
<h3><span>Bring your people.</span><span class="i">We'll bring the space.</span></h3>
<p class="p"><span>Run clubs, student groups, K-culture communities.</span><span>Host your next event at KOLLAB LA.</span></p>
<div class="wcta"><a class="pill red" href="#contact" data-who="Community">Request an event</a><a class="pill ghost" href="#events">See past formats</a></div>
</div>
<div class="ways">
<div class="way"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3"/><circle cx="17" cy="9" r="2.5"/><path d="M3 20c0-4 3-6 6-6s6 2 6 6M15 20c0-3 2-5 5-5"/></svg></div><div><b>Host at KOLLAB</b><p>Evenings and weekends in the Broadway space, with product sampling and a photo zone built in.</p></div></div>
<div class="way"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 21s-7-5-7-11a7 7 0 0 1 14 0c0 6-7 11-7 11z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="2.5"/></svg></div><div><b>Co-host a pop-up</b><p>Partner on a city stop: your community, our brands, one shared ticket link on Luma.</p></div></div>
<div class="way"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2"><path d="M4 6h16M4 12h10M4 18h7"/></svg></div><div><b>Workshops on request</b><p>K-beauty routines, skin and personal color analysis, taught by brand educators.</p></div></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="wpanel" id="w-vendor">
<div>
<h3><span>Sell at the next</span><span class="i">Seoul Social Club.</span></h3>
<p class="p"><span>Food, fashion and lifestyle vendors welcome.</span><span>We handle venue and tickets. You bring what you make.</span></p>
<div class="wcta"><a class="pill red" href="#contact" data-who="Vendor">Apply for a booth</a><a class="pill ghost" href="https://luma.com/2s3susx7" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Next stop: Atlanta</a></div>
</div>
<div class="ways">
<div class="way"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2"><path d="M3 10l2-6h14l2 6M3 10h18v10H3zM9 20v-6h6v6"/></svg></div><div><b>Booth packages</b><p>Table, signage and power included. Multi-day and multi-city rates for returning vendors.</p></div></div>
<div class="way"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2"><path d="M4 4h16v16H4zM4 9h16M9 4v16"/></svg></div><div><b>Consignment shelf</b><p>Smaller makers can test the LA market on a shelf before committing to a booth.</p></div></div>
<div class="way"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 2l3 7h7l-5.5 4.5L18 21l-6-4-6 4 1.5-7.5L2 9h7z"/></svg></div><div><b>Featured on our channels</b><p>Every vendor is introduced on @kollab_la and in our newsletter ahead of the event.</p></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
